 goes global.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"diagram-axis\" data-axis=\"x\"\n      ><span>Office-first</span><b>Where work happens</b><span>Remote-first</span></div\n    >\n  </div>\n</figure>\n","individual":true},{"label":"Drivers, then futures","html":"<figure\n  class=\"diagram\"\n  id=\"dg-quad-steps\"\n  data-type=\"quadrant\"\n  data-steps\n  data-autoplay\n  aria-label=\"Future of work 2030 scenario matrix\"\n>\n  <figcaption class=\"diagram-caption\">\n    <span class=\"diagram-eyebrow\">Scenario matrix</span>\n    <span class=\"diagram-title\">Work in 2030: four futures</span>\n    <span class=\"diagram-dek\">Two independent drivers, each a range; the cells are named bets, not data points.</span>\n  </figcaption>\n  <div class=\"diagram-canvas\">\n    <div class=\"diagram-axis\" data-axis=\"y\" data-step=\"1\" data-step-label=\"The drivers\"\n      ><span>Autonomous</span><b>AI agency</b><span>Assistive</span></div\n    >\n    <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"automated-campus\" data-step=\"2\">\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-eyebrow\">Scenario A</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Automated campus</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-meta\"\n        >Agents run the work; people come in to supervise and decide. Offices become control rooms.</span\n      >\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"agent-economy\" data-tone=\"accent\" data-step=\"3\">\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-eyebrow\">Scenario B · our bet</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Agent economy</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-meta\"\n        >Agents act for distributed teams across time zones; the org chart is a routing table.</span\n      >\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"diagram-node\" data-node=\"digital-office\" data-step=\"4\">\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-eyebrow\">Scenario C</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-name\">Digital office</span>\n      <span class=\"diagram-node-meta\"\n        >Copilots in every t